::CW_U03_PRE_Q09::[MLA.CW.FIC.04] A student adapts a source by changing only character names while keeping the exact plot and ending. What is the problem?{
~A. It changes too much.#Incorrect. It changes very little. This choice is not supported by the provided context or lesson skill; choose the option grounded in the prompt.
~B. It has no source connection.#Incorrect. It is overly close to the source.
~C. It is automatically respectful.#Incorrect. Respect also requires careful representation and purpose.
=D. It is too close to copying and lacks meaningful transformation.#Correct. Adaptation requires purposeful change. This answer matches the lesson skill and is supported by the specific creative-writing evidence in the prompt.
}

