~A. The clock explains math.#Incorrect. No math is involved. This choice is not supported by the provided context or lesson skill; choose the option grounded in the prompt.
=B. The sound detail increases tension around avoidance.#Correct. The ticking emphasizes delay. This answer matches the lesson skill and is supported by the specific creative-writing evidence in the prompt.
~C. The question disappears.#Incorrect. The question remains central. This choice is not supported by the provided context or lesson skill; choose the option grounded in the prompt.
~D. The scene becomes cheerful.#Incorrect. The mood is tense. This choice is not supported by the provided context or lesson skill; choose the option grounded in the prompt.
}
